<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`flush` renders through the one render shore, sites the file, settles the homes a siting move left, skips a byte-identical write, meets the projecting leg's gate and writes body then sidecar. `sweepLeftMirrors` reads each mirror the carrier left before anything unlinks there. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

